  "details": "I think being able to share avatars would be a great alternative to just \"saving\". If you are a model creator and have a few friends that like your avatars, you should be able to send them avatars in-game, instead of using Unity. As well as have the shared avatars be saved.\n\nIt's too much of a hassle to go find an avatar world with that one avatar you really like. I don't understand why they didn't just allow it up front, to save avatars. Importing can be a pain especially if the model isn't rigged and you have zero experience with any modeling software.",
